	<!-- Firebase phone auth's reCAPTCHA fallback returns from Safari via this
	     scheme (the encoded GOOGLE_APP_ID from GoogleService-Info.plist).
	     AppDelegate forwards it to Auth.auth().canHandle(url). Without it,
	     first-time parent sign-in fails on any device where silent APNs
	     verification is unavailable. -->
